Excuse me, General.

506
00:55:46.520 --> 00:55:49.789
How old is he, about eight?
Eight years old?

507
00:55:53.631 --> 00:55:55.422
He has blood in his eyes.

508
00:55:56.973 --> 00:56:00.353
